From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muthukumar <mk@verveflux.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Jan 2026 20:54:15 +0530
Subject: feat: Add navigator.userAgentData.setUA() method to override UA
 Client Hints

This commit implements a new navigator.userAgentData.setUA() method that
allows customizing the values returned by getHighEntropyValues(), brands(),
mobile(), and platform().

Changes:
- Added UAOverrideValues dictionary to navigator_ua_data.idl
- Added setUA() method to NavigatorUAData interface
- Implemented per-Agent-cluster override storage using UAOverrideManager
- Thread-safe singleton for Service Worker support
- Workers share Agent cluster with parent, so overrides propagate
- Modified getHighEntropyValues/brands/mobile/platform to use overrides
- Fixed NavigatorUA to cache NavigatorUAData instance
- Made NavigatorUA inherit from GarbageCollectedMixin for proper GC
- Updated NavigatorBase::Trace() to call NavigatorUA::Trace()
- Added v8_ua_override_values.{cc,h} to generated_in_core.gni

Note: This does NOT override navigator.userAgent string - only the
User-Agent Client Hints API (navigator.userAgentData).

